  <History Date="26-06-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with latest documentation (adds 36 and 39 channel modes.  charts are littered with inconsistencies.  all over the place.  doesn't know what it is.  very confusing.  remarkably similar to Robe...)" Version="3" />
